('M_a1b2c3d4e5f60001', '1.0', 'U_MEHUL_01', 'G_FOUNDERS', 'text', '2026-09-03T08:15:22+00:00', 'GROUP', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Met with Akshat and Rohan at Blue Tokai in Indiranagar, Bengaluru. We finalized the architecture diagram for MindMesh Phase 2 pipeline and agreed to use Neo4j for our graph engine.', 'Met with Akshat and Rohan at Blue Tokai in Indiranagar, Bengaluru. We finalized the architecture diagram for MindMesh Phase 2 pipeline and agreed to use Neo4j for our graph engine.', 'Planning meeting between Mehul, Akshat, and Rohan at Blue Tokai cafe to finalize the MindMesh Phase 2 pipeline architecture and select Neo4j as the graph database.', 'Architecture alignment meeting for MindMesh Phase 2 at Blue Tokai.', 'positive', ARRAY['2026-09-03']::text[], '2026-09-03T08:15:22Z', 'morning', 'completed', 'text', false, false, 'openai-compatible', 'gpt-4o', ARRAY[]::text[]),
('M_a1b2c3d4e5f60002', '1.0', 'U_MEHUL_01', NULL, 'text', '2026-09-02T19:40:10+00:00', 'ONLY_ME', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Finished reading ''Designing Data-Intensive Applications'' chapter 7 on Transactions tonight. Need to re-evaluate our serializable isolation guarantees for memory mutation operations.', 'Finished reading ''Designing Data-Intensive Applications'' chapter 7 on Transactions tonight. Need to re-evaluate our serializable isolation guarantees for memory mutation operations.', 'Personal reflection and technical insight while reading Chapter 7 of Designing Data-Intensive Applications regarding transaction isolation levels and concurrency control.', 'Notes on Chapter 7 of DDIA regarding database transaction guarantees.', 'neutral', ARRAY['2026-09-02']::text[], '2026-09-02T19:40:00Z', 'night', 'completed', 'text', false, false, 'openai-compatible', 'gpt-4o', ARRAY[]::text[]),
